| Removed `import java.io.*`, `java.lang.*`, `java.util.*` | All were unused; `java.lang` is auto-imported |
| `Boolean[]` → `boolean[]` | Eliminates unnecessary boxing; primitive `boolean` defaults to `false`, removing the init loop |
| `== false` → `!` | Idiomatic Java |
| `int key[]` → `int[] key` (etc.) | Modern Java array declaration style |
| Extracted `INFINITY` constant | Avoids repeating `Integer.MAX_VALUE` magic number |
| Made `minKey` `private` | It's an internal helper, not part of the public API |
| Added `if (u == -1) break` guard | Prevents `ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException` on disconnected graphs |
| `min_index` → `minIndex` | Java camelCase convention |

The algorithm's logic and output are unchanged.

